<title>USA: Aztar casino posts Feb revs of $27.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Aztar casino posts Feb revs of $27.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aztar Corp on Monday its Tropicana Casino and Resort in Atlantic City, New Jersey, said its February revenues rose to $27.3 million from $25.6 million in the same month of 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;The Atlantic City market is recording a strong start in 1997 aided by relatively mild winter weather on the East Coast,&quot; Chairman, President and Chief Executive Paul Rubeli said in a statement.</p>
</text>
